Who would have thought that humanity would face far more dangers and anxieties in the future, many of which would predict the apocalypse and become a true "eclipse" for humanity? Today, you have the opportunity to download The Red Solstice 2: Survivors torrent and embark on a thrilling adventure as a mercenary forced to carry out dangerous missions not only for profit but also to save humanity. After all, humanity is now forced to flee from a dangerous virus that transforms all living things into dangerous and bloodthirsty monsters. If you're ready to fight back, we suggest you waste no time and just get started. Good luck!

Game features
- you will be able to download The Red Solstice 2: Survivors via torrent in Russian;
- the game features a cooperative mode for up to 8 people;
- explore locations, collect useful resources and use a variety of items;
- don't forget to actively develop your character, improving not only his characteristics, but also other skills;
- be sure to study the list of auxiliary abilities, many of which will have mass damage;
- perform various tasks, leave one area and go on missions to other colonies;
- your enemy will be biomass, which can transform and pose a great threat;
- each class in the game is unique in its own way, take into account its features and achieve success;
- the time has come to fight an unpredictable battle, the outcome of which will determine the future of humanity.

